# Entity Modules

## Folder Layout

Each module under `src/entities/<name>/`:

```
index.ts                    # Entity class (public API)
interfaces/*.interface.ts   # Request/response types per operation
types/*.type.ts             # Optional: domain unions for that resource
__tests__/                  # Colocated unit tests (excluded from build)
```

Add `types/` only when the resource has discrete Bling values that are not already in `@shared`.

Reference layouts: `src/entities/camposCustomizados/`, `src/entities/contatos/`, `src/entities/nfes/`, `src/entities/empresas/`.

## Base Class

All entities extend `Entity` from `src/entities/@shared/entity.ts`:

- Receives `IBlingRepository` via constructor (injected by `Bling` or tests).
- Provides `prepareStringOrDateParam` for `Date` → API string conversion via `src/helpers/functions/convert-date-to-string.ts`.

## Class Conventions

- Export a **PascalCase** class matching the folder purpose (e.g. `CamposCustomizados` in `src/entities/camposCustomizados/index.ts`).
- Class-level JSDoc links to the Bling reference section (`@see https://developer.bling.com.br/referencia#/<Resource>`).
- Methods are `async` and return `Promise<...>`. Repository-backed methods document `@throws {BlingApiException|BlingInternalException}` and a `@see` link to the Bling operation.

## Common Method Names

Align with Bling semantics used across the codebase:

| Method | Typical repository call | Reference |
|--------|----------------------|-----------|
| `get` | `index` | `src/entities/produtos/index.ts` |
| `find` | `show` | `src/entities/contatos/index.ts` |
| `create` | `store` | `src/entities/camposCustomizados/index.ts` |
| `update` | `update` or `replace` | `src/entities/camposCustomizados/index.ts`, `src/entities/contatos/index.ts` |
| `delete` | `destroy` | `src/entities/camposCustomizados/index.ts` |
| `changeSituation` | `update` or `replace` on `.../situacoes` | `src/entities/produtos/index.ts` |

Domain-specific names mirror Bling actions: `send`, `download`, `postStock`, `reverseAccounts`, `generateNfe`, `me`, etc. See `src/entities/nfes/index.ts`, `src/entities/contasReceber/index.ts`, `src/entities/empresas/index.ts`.

## Endpoint & Parameter Patterns

- **Endpoints**: kebab-case path segments (`campos-customizados`, `contas/receber`, `nfe`).
- **Resource ids**: `String(params.idXxx)` in `show`/`update`/`destroy`.
- **Nested routes**: embed in `id` (e.g. `` id: `${params.idContato}/tipos` `` in `src/entities/contatos/index.ts`).
- **Bulk delete**: `destroy` with `id: ''` and ids in `params` (`src/entities/produtos/index.ts`, `src/entities/contatos/index.ts`).
- **Date filters**: `this.prepareStringOrDateParam(value)` or `this.prepareStringOrDateParam(value, true)` when Bling expects datetime (second argument is positional; see `src/entities/contatos/index.ts`).
- **Update params**: destructure id from params, pass remainder as `body` (`src/entities/camposCustomizados/index.ts`).

## Shared Types

Reuse `@shared` types only when the Bling field uses the **same value set** (`uf.type.ts`, `tipoPessoa.type.ts`, `origem.type.ts`, …). `@shared/types/situacao.type.ts` is **only** `0 | 1` (inactive/active). Resource-specific situação enums belong in that module’s `types/situacao.type.ts` (see `src/entities/contatos/types/situacao.type.ts`, `src/entities/produtos/types/situacao.type.ts`).

## Public Visibility

Most entity methods use `public`; some older modules omit the keyword — match the prevailing style in the sibling file being edited.
